  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project on Utilization of Eco-friendly Paper Buoys for the Sustainable Marine Aquaculture in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In connection with the local government of Quang Ninh Province and its local partner STP Group, about 5,000 eco-friendly paper buoys are distributed as pilot projects to 150 households in the pilot fishing village district. Paper buoys that have been certified in domestic tests will be applied in accordance with the buoys certification standards of Quanglin Province, Vietnam</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In connection with the local government of Quang Ninh Province and its local partner STP Group, about 5,000 eco-friendly paper buoys are distributed as pilot projects to 150 households in the pilot fishing village district. Paper buoys that have been certified in domestic tests will be applied in accordance with the buoys certification standards of Quanglin Province, Vietnam1. &#xB3D9;&#xC77C;&#xC6A9;&#xB7C9; &#xAE30;&#xC874; &#xBD80;&#xD45C; &#xB300;&#xBE44; &#xC885;&#xC774;&#xBD80;&#xD45C; &#xD658;&#xACBD;&#xBE44;&#xC6A9; 40% &#xC808;&#xAC10;, 2. &#xC885;&#xC774;&#xBD80;&#xD45C; &#xC2DC;&#xBC94;&#xD310;&#xB9E4;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC2E0;&#xADDC;&#xACC4;&#xC57D;</narrative>
